  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Explain the statement 'Our unity is our strength and our diversity is our power' in the context of the entire narrative, drawing connections to the actions and themes presented.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Evaluate the effectiveness of storytelling as a method for preserving and bringing history to life, using the provided text as a reference point for your discussion.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Describe the educational components mentioned in the text, including the use of technology and specific learning approaches, and how they align with the festival's theme.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('febabd41-d799-40c5-97e0-7a7e6ec977fb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$In the futuristic world of Unionville, all countries have merged into one grand nation known as ‘The Big Brood’. This monumental shift was driven by a collective desire to overcome historical divisions and foster a society where citizens live in harmony despite their diverse cultural backgrounds, traditions, and histories. The annual ‘Great Unity Festival’ serves as a vibrant testament to this shared vision, bringing together people from all walks of life to celebrate their collective identity and the successful integration of once-separate nations. This year, the festival's excitement was palpable, particularly as two seventh graders, Deepti and Rosy, prepared a unique presentation focusing on personal stories of adaptation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('60402550-01c0-4d87-bfaa-c71e77fb0c1e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti and Rosy, two seventh graders with a shared passion for history and storytelling, were tasked with creating a presentation for ‘The Great Unity Festival’. Their brainstorming session in the school library revealed their innovative approach. Deepti humorously imagined a school with borders, requiring a 'passport' to move between classes, highlighting the absurdity of division. Rosy then built upon this, suggesting a skit about crossing imaginary borders to attend classes. Their focus was not on grand political narratives but on the intimate, personal experiences of individuals adapting to a unified world, aiming to make the concept of unity relatable and tangible for their audience.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('20a838b5-beea-4f21-955f-77d5baf885dc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text introduces Tuvalu as an independent country with no borders and no army, prompting a discussion about values to be learned from it. This example serves as a real-world parallel to the fictional 'Big Brood', a futuristic nation where all countries have merged into one. Both scenarios, real and imagined, challenge conventional notions of national identity and security. The 'Big Brood' actively celebrates its unity through 'The Great Unity Festival', emphasizing harmony despite diverse cultures. The story implicitly asks readers to consider the benefits and implications of a world without traditional divisions, encouraging reflection on how societies can achieve peace and cooperation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c35e492b-8c35-430a-800e-85050e0c2f27', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The lesson outlines several learning outcomes, including reading with correct pronunciation, exploring themes, learning new words, answering questions, using pronouns correctly, and writing an analytical paragraph. These objectives suggest an educational system designed to equip students with not only linguistic proficiency but also critical thinking and cultural appreciation. In a unified world like 'The Big Brood', where diverse cultures coexist, such comprehensive learning outcomes are vital for fostering understanding, communication, and the ability to analyze complex social dynamics.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('07fda099-0654-473c-a70a-2891def4a941', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti and Rosy's shared passion for history and storytelling was a key factor in their selection to create a presentation for 'The Great Unity Festival'. Their decision to focus on 'personal stories of how people adapted to living in a unified world' underscores the power of narrative in fostering empathy and understanding. Instead of abstract concepts, they aimed to present relatable human experiences, demonstrating that unity is built not just on political mergers but on individual journeys of integration and shared humanity. This approach highlights storytelling as a powerful tool for cultural cohesion.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('fc039beb-0277-46d2-aaa0-a45bfe1fbad0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$'The Great Unity Festival' is described as an annual event where the citizens of 'The Big Brood' celebrate their unity. This festival is more than just a celebration; it acts as a powerful symbol of their collective identity, reinforcing the idea that despite their varied origins, they are now one nation. Such events play a crucial role in nation-building, creating shared memories, traditions, and a sense of belonging among a diverse populace. The excitement buzzing in Unionville suggests its success in fostering a strong communal spirit.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5b95ff59-84e3-4e10-b69b-cd770c2dc22d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti's excited remark, 'Imagine if we had borders in our school! You’d need a passport just to go from one class to another,' serves as a humorous yet poignant illustration of the absurdity of excessive division. By applying the concept of national borders to a familiar, everyday setting like a school, she highlights the inconvenience and illogical nature of such barriers. This analogy effectively communicates the benefits of a borderless, unified environment, making the abstract concept of 'The Big Brood' more understandable and appealing.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a5858323-3f74-4ab1-91b7-99795cf3c5a1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The selection of two seventh graders, Deepti and Rosy, to create a presentation for 'The Great Unity Festival' is significant. It suggests that even the youth are integral to shaping the narrative of unity and adaptation in 'The Big Brood'. Their fresh perspective, combined with their passion for history and storytelling, allows them to approach the theme in a way that resonates with their peers and potentially the wider community. This highlights the importance of engaging younger generations in civic and cultural celebrations.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('af9e61b4-3e15-4afc-a018-79636ee89661', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story explicitly states that Deepti and Rosy's presentation focused on 'personal stories of how people adapted to living in a unified world.' This emphasis on adaptation suggests that the transition to 'The Big Brood' was not without its challenges, requiring individuals to adjust their perspectives, habits, and perhaps even their sense of identity. The success of 'The Big Brood' hinges on the willingness and ability of its citizens to embrace these changes and find common ground, highlighting the dynamic process of integration.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f926e1b2-baaf-49f6-a496-072e7f758929', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The scene in the school library, where Deepti and Rosy are 'surrounded by books and papers, brainstorming ideas,' portrays the library not just as a place for quiet study but as a vibrant hub for creative thought and collaboration. This setting underscores the importance of resources and an inspiring environment for intellectual work. It suggests that the school system in Unionville supports and encourages students to explore, research, and develop innovative ideas for community engagement.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('245c6bd7-5655-4f1e-8077-c7d3017860e7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The mention of Tuvalu as a country with 'no army' raises questions about national security and the nature of peace. In a world where 'The Big Brood' has merged all countries, the need for individual national armies might diminish or transform. This concept challenges the traditional reliance on military power for sovereignty and suggests an alternative model where security is maintained through unity, diplomacy, or a collective defense mechanism. It prompts reflection on the possibility of a truly demilitarized global society.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('abc3f4fa-8820-43b3-adcd-574301faa230', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Among the learning outcomes, 'read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions' highlights the nuanced aspects of verbal communication. In a diverse, unified world like 'The Big Brood', where people from different linguistic backgrounds come together, clear and expressive communication is paramount. Intonation and expression convey meaning beyond words, fostering better understanding and empathy, which are essential for maintaining harmony across cultural divides.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('cc6c765d-3fe1-4b38-b2c6-621423a2daa0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti's reaction to imaginary school borders—finding the idea 'hilarious'—reveals a perspective that views division as inherently absurd and unnecessary in certain contexts. This lighthearted approach to a serious topic allows for a critical examination of borders without immediately resorting to heavy political discourse. By framing it as humorous, the text invites readers to question the conventional acceptance of divisions and consider the practical and social benefits of unity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('156a2f74-5bce-4187-95ce-de82dba350ed', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text includes prompts like 'What values should we learn from this country? Discuss in class' and 'What was unique about the themes chosen by Deepti and Rosy? Discuss in class.' These prompts are integral to the pedagogical approach, encouraging active learning, critical thinking, and collaborative discussion. They transform the text from a passive reading exercise into an interactive learning experience, fostering deeper engagement with the themes of unity, diversity, and societal values.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('0a93bef2-a83e-4cc5-9c83-d16fb08976d3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The merging of all countries into 'The Big Brood' implies a significant evolution in the concept of national identity. Citizens, once identifying with their individual nations, now belong to a larger, unified entity. This shift requires a redefinition of patriotism and belonging, moving from allegiance to a specific landmass or culture to a broader sense of shared humanity within 'The Big Brood'. The festival serves as a crucial mechanism for solidifying this new, inclusive identity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('be80e7e0-6ce3-4fab-a953-0caf1aa73314', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text describes the narrative as a 'beautiful story' that explores the world of 'Big Brood' and how citizens live in harmony despite differences. This framing suggests an intentional effort to present a positive and aspirational vision of a unified society. The story's beauty lies not just in its narrative but in its underlying message of hope and possibility for overcoming historical divides, making it a didactic tool for promoting values of peace and cooperation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3fe8271a-8dba-4fe6-b5d5-502da989cf5f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy's suggestion to 'share our presentation with a skit about crossing imaginary borders to attend classes' demonstrates a practical and engaging approach to conveying their message. A skit, being visual and interactive, can effectively illustrate abstract concepts like borders and unity in a memorable way for an audience, especially for a festival setting. This choice reflects an understanding of effective communication strategies for diverse audiences.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f4a5f3ee-9d27-4170-9097-f42def429130', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The fact that Deepti and Rosy are 'seventh graders' is not merely a detail but highlights the idea that even young individuals can contribute meaningfully to significant societal events. It implies an educational system that empowers students to take initiative and engage with complex social themes. Their age also suggests that the message of unity is being instilled from a young age, ensuring its continuity across generations in 'The Big Brood'.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a2967f93-0b1d-43e6-8c50-408d67106d50', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti and Rosy's shared 'passion for history' is notable, especially as they are tasked with presenting on unity in a world that has merged its past divisions. This suggests that understanding history, even a history of differences, is crucial for appreciating the present unity and for learning how to adapt. By acknowledging the past, they can better articulate the journey towards a harmonious future, ensuring that the lessons of history are not forgotten but integrated into the new narrative of 'The Big Brood'.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d5d9bcf7-1cc4-437f-b86d-0a6d0ce6c140', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$One of the learning outcomes is to 'explore and appreciate the theme.' This goes beyond mere comprehension, encouraging students to delve deeper into the underlying messages and values of the story. 'Exploring' implies critical inquiry and analysis, while 'appreciating' suggests an emotional and intellectual connection to the theme of unity and harmony. This outcome aims to cultivate not just knowledge, but also empathy and a positive disposition towards the ideals presented.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('0aca5fd2-6a16-4994-b921-aa9480d31de5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The description of 'The Big Brood' as a 'futuristic world' allows the author to explore societal ideals and challenges that might not yet exist. This setting provides a canvas for imagining a transformed global order where traditional conflicts are overcome. It invites readers to consider possibilities for human cooperation and progress, free from the constraints of current political realities, making the story both imaginative and thought-provoking about humanity's potential future.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9d9acbb5-cf48-4e23-8ba0-23af3acae702', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text highlights that Deepti and Rosy 'shared a deep bond forged by their passion for history and storytelling.' This emphasizes the importance of strong interpersonal connections and shared interests in successful collaboration. Their bond likely facilitated open communication, mutual support, and a synergistic creative process, allowing them to develop an innovative presentation. This illustrates how personal relationships can significantly enhance collective endeavors, especially in a unified society.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('84585dd3-b7cb-4df9-b502-53941773c223', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The requirement to 'write an analytical paragraph' as a learning outcome signifies the importance of higher-order thinking skills. It tasks students with dissecting information, identifying patterns, interpreting meaning, and presenting a reasoned argument about the text's content or themes. This skill is crucial for citizens in a complex, unified world, enabling them to critically evaluate information and articulate their perspectives effectively, contributing to informed public discourse.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('37a56417-eed2-40ef-add6-38a0a5bdcb86', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The concept of 'The Big Brood' can be viewed as a grand social experiment: merging all countries into one nation to achieve harmony despite differences. This ambitious undertaking tests the limits of human cooperation and the ability to transcend historical conflicts. The success of 'The Great Unity Festival' and the focus on personal adaptation stories suggest that this experiment is, at least in part, succeeding, offering a hopeful model for future global governance and inter-cultural relations.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('50dd2828-6b6f-4303-86f3-1cf919032242', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy and Deepti visit their neighbours to collect more information about ‘The Big Brood’. Mr Faiz is sitting in his cosy study room.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('fa1d8128-6a17-416c-a386-9bd2e6aae8f6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mr Faiz (with a twinkle in his eye): On the day of joining, leaders tied their flags together as a symbol of unity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('16d8be6a-acd6-4067-9a9a-61240cfbd3bd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Then, someone had the bright idea to tie shoelaces together, too. It turned into quite a spectacle, with everyone tripping over each other!$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('44e3502c-e19e-4a2e-821d-451d2efa433e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Laughter fills the room as Deepti sketches cartoons to illustrate the tale. They thank Mr Faiz and leave.]$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('2d6bc5e2-a814-45a8-b752-2a90c64884c5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Scene 3: Grandma Laima’s kitchen — Deepti and Rosy stand beside Grandma Laima, who is cooking a sweet dish, phirni.]$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('50572099-4823-4784-b61b-77f62bdfca2a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Grandma Laima (with a smile): | remember our first celebration after The Big Brood was formed. | mixed up the phirni recipe and doubled the sugar by mistake.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
