  ('cf4806af-52c7-46f3-bae8-0ae5d20369e9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mr Faiz, an elderly neighbour, entertains them with stories.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('b2cbb824-f4d5-472f-9d4c-bba9a87713a2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Grandma Laima (with a smile): | remember our first celebration after The Big Brood was formed.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('ec738a63-ac69-4df5-80d1-fb6ad2e6d1cd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Everyone loved the extra sweetness. It was a sign of sweet beginnings for us. Everyone was delighted.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('aabb584a-0a6c-4932-83b1-c82e57a30af6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti (addressing the crowd): Welcome to ‘The Great Unity Festival’! Today, we're sharing stories of changes adopted in a unified world.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('695ccea2-1a28-4ad1-9ef8-0239499afd48', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy (excitedly): Ever wondered what life would be like if we were always divided and restricted? Well, get ready for a laughter ride as we dive into that wacky world!$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('7b0903eb-4965-4229-9414-8ab9b5943e0d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Great Unity Festival — Stalls and stages fill the area, showcasing the diversity of The Big Brood.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('6b9a2e17-271f-4474-8c1f-c87703752cef', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Act 3] [Scene: The Unity Parade — participants carry pieces of fabric from their traditional clothing, contributing to a communal drapery. Suddenly, a gust of wind threatens to carry it away.] Deepti (alarmed): The drapery! Hold it tight. [The crowd reacts quickly, holding onto the drapery to keep it from flying away.] Rosy (straining): We can’t lose it! [Among the crowd, Deepti and Rosy spot Mr Faiz and Grandma Laima. They are holding the drapery, smiling as if to say, ‘Don’t worry’, we are there.] Mr Faiz (shouting over the wind): Together, we keep our unity strong! Together, we create a rainbow. [The crowd cheers.]$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6d4d8d08-be34-4f62-aab5-088a1bd6e9aa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The festival concludes with Deepti and Rosy reflecting on their experience. Deepti: Our project truly brought people together. Rosy: Just like the festival’s theme—unity in diversity. Use Cordova Smart Class Software on the smart board in class to understand the theme of global unity. TIME FOR DISCUSSION Our unity is our strength and our diversity is our power. [SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities]$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('570d12de-015d-4ecf-81bf-0cd2301e6144', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story introduces a futuristic world called 'The Big Brood', where all countries have merged into one large nation. This unified world celebrates its cohesion with an annual event known as ‘The Great Unity Festival’. This year, the festival generated considerable excitement in Unionville, a specific location within 'The Big Brood'.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4a6cbafc-caef-41c5-a8d1-198e036a4f14', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Two seventh graders, Deepti and Rosy, were chosen to play a special role in 'The Great Unity Festival'. They were more than just classmates; their deep bond was formed by a shared passion for history and storytelling. Their task was to create a presentation for the festival, focusing on how individuals adapted to living in this newly unified world.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1a36b849-cc2b-4610-aa04-2823552bc3cc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$During their brainstorming session in the school library in Unionville, Deepti and Rosy explored ideas for their presentation. Deepti humorously suggested that if their school had borders, one would need a passport to move between classes, like from history to music. Rosy found this idea brilliant and proposed incorporating a skit about crossing imaginary borders into their presentation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('eb0fe1b0-3b91-480d-94ca-97aa2ca0ac04', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story begins by posing a question about Tuvalu, an independent country known for having no borders and no army, asking what values can be learned from it. This sets a reflective tone, preparing the reader to explore the theme of unity and harmony, which is central to the narrative of 'The Big Brood'.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c8f7a5ec-0399-4ab5-b7e5-9103e7c6fb48', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The learning outcomes for the lesson are clearly stated: students will be able to read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation, and expressions; explore and appreciate the theme; learn new words and use them in sentences; answer questions based on the story; use pronouns and their types correctly; and write an analytical paragraph.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f9a440e5-e2fe-4d80-a3c0-c22fb344cc06', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The beautiful story explores the world of ‘Big Brood’, where citizens live in harmony despite their differences in culture, traditions, and history. The narrative aims to illustrate how individuals successfully adapt to living in a unified world, emphasizing the possibility of peaceful coexistence amidst diversity.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7fa13ff7-38b8-4876-998f-d86d0528097d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Great Unity Festival, an annual event, is a cornerstone of the unified nation, 'The Big Brood'. It serves as a vibrant celebration of the merging of all countries into one, reinforcing the collective identity and shared purpose of its diverse citizenry. The palpable excitement in Unionville this year underscored its success in fostering communal spirit.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3e0d0739-ebbf-490e-b08a-149d2814a0af', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti and Rosy's deep bond was not merely coincidental but 'forged by their passion for history and storytelling.' This shared intellectual and creative interest provided a strong foundation for their collaboration, enabling them to approach their presentation task with enthusiasm and a unified vision. Their synergy was evident in their brainstorming session.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d8018486-7496-48a0-a3c1-cb07dde1a27b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The unique aspect of Deepti and Rosy's presentation theme was its focus on 'personal stories of how people adapted to living in a unified world.' Instead of a broad historical overview, they chose to highlight individual experiences, making the concept of unity relatable and human-centric. This approach aimed to connect with the audience on an emotional level.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e3e1bc3e-04cc-4523-8bf8-3f51029928bf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti's humorous analogy about school borders—'You’d need a passport just to go from one class to another'—was a creative way to illustrate the inconvenience and absurdity of divisions. By applying a national concept to a familiar setting, she made the abstract idea of borders tangible and highlighted the benefits of a seamless, unified environment.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7de096ab-3ab3-48b6-b4bf-fd662ff50dfa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy's immediate reaction to Deepti's idea was laughter and an affirmation: 'That’s a brilliant idea!' She then built upon it, suggesting, 'What if we share our presentation with a skit about crossing imaginary borders to attend classes?' This shows their collaborative spirit and how one idea can spark another, leading to a more developed concept.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('47f8e1e8-8a73-43b7-8ef8-7baf5e1d6eb6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The setting for Act 1, Scene 1 is 'The school library in Unionville,' where Deepti and Rosy are 'surrounded by books and papers, brainstorming ideas.' This environment suggests a place of learning, research, and creative incubation, providing the necessary resources and atmosphere for their intellectual task.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('70cdfc75-541a-4202-9990-17ffe4637515', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story explores the concept of individuals adapting to a unified world. This implies that the transition to 'The Big Brood' involved significant changes for its citizens, requiring them to adjust their perspectives and embrace a new collective identity. The success of this adaptation is crucial for maintaining harmony.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('af970d76-01db-4dd5-81c6-5afbe3bd5634', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text states that citizens of ‘The Big Brood’ live in harmony despite their differences in culture, traditions, and history. This highlights a core value of the unified nation: the ability to coexist peacefully and respectfully, acknowledging and even celebrating diversity rather than letting it be a source of conflict.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f6fd7c76-44b4-414a-a907-6ce7368cabfd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The initial question about Tuvalu, 'What values should we learn from this country?', serves as a prompt for critical thinking. It encourages readers to consider the implications of a nation without borders or an army, and to reflect on how such characteristics might contribute to peace and cooperation, setting a moral and ethical framework for the story.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ec44204d-4f75-4975-8994-82fc95dcf852', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$One of the lesson's learning outcomes is to 'explore and appreciate the theme.' This means students are expected to delve deeply into the central ideas of unity and harmony, understanding their nuances and significance, and developing a personal connection or positive regard for these concepts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('dd9d2572-bde8-4971-b548-5489c91b307d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story is set in a 'futuristic world' called Unionville, which is part of 'The Big Brood'. This setting allows the narrative to imagine a transformed global landscape, free from current geopolitical constraints, and to present an idealized vision of human society where unity has been achieved on a grand scale.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7c076b67-998c-4686-8def-42dd2dfc5b4d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'Great Unity Festival' is an 'annual event,' indicating its established and recurring nature. This regularity suggests that the celebration of unity is a continuous effort, not a one-time achievement, requiring ongoing reinforcement to maintain the cohesion of 'The Big Brood's diverse population.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('063cea91-82c1-4fc4-8814-e887479c4b49', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti and Rosy were 'selected to create a presentation,' implying a competitive or merit-based process. This suggests that their skills in history and storytelling, along with their deep bond, were recognized and valued by the organizers of 'The Great Unity Festival', highlighting the importance of talent and collaboration in this society.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d57041b0-ff54-4c98-9414-d4408b82c559', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'buzzed with excitement' describes the atmosphere of the festival in Unionville. This vivid imagery conveys a sense of energy, anticipation, and widespread enthusiasm among the citizens, indicating a successful and engaging event that genuinely resonates with the community.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('50ce508d-0358-4920-a693-063c12ee699c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The learning outcome 'learn new words and use them in sentences' emphasizes practical vocabulary acquisition. This skill is fundamental for effective communication, especially in a diverse nation like 'The Big Brood' where a common language, enriched by varied cultural expressions, would be essential for mutual understanding.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('af7b2772-6e4e-4941-9440-d118f9017beb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story is presented as a 'beautiful story' that 'explores the world of ‘Big Brood’.' This framing suggests that the narrative is not just informative but also aesthetically pleasing and thought-provoking, designed to engage readers emotionally and intellectually with its themes of harmony and adaptation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('0a0634dd-a3a7-44ed-96d1-7f6afbdf0e30', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti's excited tone when imagining school borders ('excitedly') and Rosy's laughter ('laughing') indicate their positive and creative engagement with the task. Their joyful interaction suggests that learning and collaboration in Unionville are fostered in an environment that encourages imagination and lighthearted exploration of ideas.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9e0010e2-d4b7-4655-9189-dc38a648bf7c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The lesson aims for students to be able to 'answer questions based on the story.' This fundamental comprehension skill ensures that students have grasped the factual content and narrative details of the text, forming the basis for deeper analysis and discussion of its themes and implications.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d014671b-dfc6-4023-8219-31ca05f7959c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy and Deepti visit their neighbours to collect more information about ‘The Big Brood’. Mr Faiz is sitting in his cosy study room. Deepti and Rosy sit on a couch while Mr Faiz, an elderly neighbour, entertains them with stories.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ae9bcec0-954d-4053-98ba-f0b4f490f18a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mr Faiz (with a twinkle in his eye): On the day of joining, leaders tied their flags together as a symbol of unity. Then, someone had the bright idea to tie shoelaces together, too. It turned into quite a spectacle, with everyone tripping over each other!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('597f7b9d-8403-4e3b-818b-8ff0eade2aaa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Laughter fills the room as Deepti sketches cartoons to illustrate the tale. They thank Mr Faiz and leave.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('6ab26207-503a-4a19-b20f-56deb090229e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Scene 3: Grandma Laima’s kitchen — Deepti and Rosy stand beside Grandma Laima, who is cooking a sweet dish, phirni.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8b78bbc1-ca52-4b49-bb15-ee90c14a1c3f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Grandma Laima (with a smile): | remember our first celebration after The Big Brood was formed. | mixed up the phirni recipe and doubled the sugar by mistake. But it was a hit! Everyone loved the extra sweetness.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1b9aeb63-8fc4-4c8e-9405-204fd7573600', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$It was a sign of sweet beginnings for us. Everyone was delighted. What does Grandma Liama mean by sweet beginnings? [She hands them each a bowl of freshly cooked phirni. Jotting down facts, both Deepti and Rosy thank Grandma and exit.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('66d617e4-82e5-4dcb-a9aa-ac695ba47f84', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[Act 2] [Scene: The Great Unity Festival — Stalls and stages fill the area, showcasing the diversity of The Big Brood. Deepti and Rosy stand at their booth, presenting their project.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7e55b15e-1bc6-4b09-9e2b-927e22a43ca4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Deepti (addressing the crowd): Welcome to ‘The Great Unity Festival’! Today, we're sharing stories of changes adopted in a unified world.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('36b80b24-ce46-4406-9096-63e8673c9f19', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Rosy (excitedly): Let’s start with a funny skit about crossing pretended borders between classes. Ever wondered what life would be like if we were always divided and restricted? Well, get ready for a laughter ride as we dive into that wacky world!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7575d3ae-75ba-4f67-9d52-0031a4903994', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Music Sir (enquiring): Show your passport to enter the class.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('cdbd72c3-cd47-4fc2-a597-700379de33d0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Canteen Vendor (remorseful): Sorry, you don’t have the VISA to have the midday meal today.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8044f056-aa38-4c55-b04b-8856e585d01e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Science Lab (apologetic): Ohh! Your medical insurance has expired for entering the labs. Get it renewed. Until then, manage with theory classes.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('14d69017-92b4-4467-8536-ea324f022e9b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '08fb2149-399c-48e2-954e-d64a0e955ad5', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Sports Teacher (stoically): You require an international stroll permit to enter the playground. Different permits are required to enter different play zones.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
